  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nWhen you drag an item in the browser (native drag & drop), of all browsers only Chromium actually scrolls when you near the edge of the viewport. This behavior seems pretty obvious & useful. But none of the other browsers behave this way.\r\n\r\nIs this spec'ed and if not, perhaps it should be?",
